"""Unified Asset & Service Inventory View for CyberSecuritySuite.

Provides a clean enterprise asset management interface matching Professional Dark UI/UX:
- Master Asset Inventory table (Host, IP, Open Ports, Services, OS, Risk Score, Verification).
- Real-time search and multi-criteria filtering (by IP, hostname, OS, port, risk).
- Auspex Observatory-style slide-out Asset Inspector drawer.
- Quick actions: Copy IP, launch targeted port scan, inspect vulnerability provenance.
- Strictly backed by real SQLite database assets (AssetNode, PortResult, Finding).
- Zero fabricated nodes: 100% database-backed.
"""

